    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "header",
            "block_content": "Section 93A ",
            "block_bbox": [
                906,
                88,
                1054,
                115
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": null
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "employer-sponsors of not more than the allowable percentage of the members of the fund; and ",
            "block_bbox": [
                457,
                148,
                984,
                203
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(ii) the value of the accrued benefits of those members of the fund who have as an employer-sponsor either the trustee or an associate of the trustee is not more than the allowable percentage of the value of the assets of the fund; and \n",
            "block_bbox": [
                411,
                207,
                1044,
                347
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(iii) the trustee satisfies the requirements in paragraphs (a),(c), (d) and (e) of the definition of independent trustee in section 10..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                397,
                354,
                1029,
                435
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(2) The allowable percentage of the members of the fund is 10% or such higher percentage as is approved by APRA by notice in writing given to the trustee..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                285,
                456,
                1006,
                542
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) The allowable percentage of the value of the assets of the fund is 10% or such higher percentage as is approved by APRA by notice in writing given to the trustee..\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                278,
                562,
                1028,
                649
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(4) If APRA approves a higher percentage under subsection (2) or (3),the approval may be subject to such conditions (if any) as are specified in the notice.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                273,
                671,
                1032,
                755
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(5) An approval, including any conditions to which the approval is subject, may be varied at any time by APRA by notice in writing given to the trustee.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                269,
                781,
                1012,
                863
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(6) APRA may only exercise the power conferred under subsection (2)or (3) after considering:",
            "block_bbox": [
                268,
                889,
                1035,
                941
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a) the effect that the approval of a higher percentage will have on the likelihood of the trustee performing its functions independently and impartially; and.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                329,
                950,
                1013,
                1032
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) all other relevant circumstances.",
            "block_bbox": [
                327,
                1040,
                721,
                1064
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "footer",
            "block_content": "Superannuation Industry (Supervision) Act 1993",
            "block_bbox": [
                451,
                1300,
                828,
                1320
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
